                "text": "High overturn rates mean insurance companies wrongfully deny care, forcing patients to jump through hurdles to receive necessary procedures. Health insurance companies must reverse their practices of delaying and denying patient care. Healthcare shouldn't be a cash cow. https://t.co/hRM9rpOOjB",
