                "text": "She\u2019s also the inspiration for my new bill, the Compassion for Vulnerable and Struggling Workers Act, which would ensure that fired federal employees do not see a lapse in health coverage.\n\u00a0\nBehind these firings and cuts are real people who stand to get hurt. We need to do better for them.",
