                "text": "The Affordable Care Act saves lives.\n\u00a0\nWe will not go back to a time when people with preexisting health conditions could be denied coverage.\n\nI remain committed to building on the ACA\u2019s promises and possibilities that began on this day 15 years ago. https://t.co/aW0QhY3zzk",
